-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §124 טבלאות שכר משולב וגמול סגנות: an
-- academic young-division head who is not a first deputy is on the academic
-- teachers' tables, with a young-division management allowance of 13% of
-- his combined salary by his position (to 100%); pension recognition and
-- contributions on it; one who is a second deputy gets that allowance
-- only.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `124 טבלאות שכר משולב וגמול סגנות`

@ref akn:art_124__para_a
`a young-division head is on the academic teachers' tables` MEANS TRUE

-- (ב): 13% of the combined salary by the position, to 100%.
@ref akn:art_124__para_b
GIVEN `full-position combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the young-division management allowance` `full-position combined salary` `position fraction` IS
    13% TIMES `full-position combined salary` TIMES min `position fraction` 1

DECLARE `section 124 action` IS ONE OF
    `act to have the young-division allowance recognised as permanent for the pension law`
    `make accrual-pension contributions on the young-division allowance`
    `make study-fund contributions on the young-division allowance`

@ref akn:art_124__para_c
GIVEN `insured in an accrual pension` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 124 action`
DECIDE `the pension on the young-division allowance` `insured in an accrual pension` IS
    IF `insured in an accrual pension`
    THEN PARTY `the State` MUST `make accrual-pension contributions on the young-division allowance`
         LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 124(ג): accrual-pension contributions on the allowance"
    ELSE PARTY `the State` MUST `act to have the young-division allowance recognised as permanent for the pension law`
         LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 124(ג): the State acts for the allowance's recognition"

@ref akn:art_124__para_d
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 124 action`
DECIDE `the study fund on the young-division allowance` IS
    PARTY `the State` MUST `make study-fund contributions on the young-division allowance`
    LEST BREACH BY `the State` BECAUSE "section 124(ד): study-fund contributions on the allowance"

-- (ה): a young-division head who is a second deputy: this allowance only,
-- not the deputyship allowance as well.
@ref akn:art_124__para_e
DECLARE `allowance of a head who is a second deputy` IS ONE OF `the young-division allowance`, `the deputyship allowance`

`the allowances of a young-division head who is a second deputy` MEANS LIST `the young-division allowance`

#ASSERT `the young-division management allowance` 9000 1.2 EQUALS 1170
#ASSERT `the young-division management allowance` 9000 0.5 EQUALS 585
